---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us & Community Vision | Jabalpuriya.com"
  description="Jabalpuriya.com is a dedicated digital news portal and community platform connecting the residents and global diaspora of Sanskaardhani Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0c1c33] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider bg-jabalpur-secondary/10 text-jabalpur-secondary border border-jabalpur-secondary/20">
          Our Vision & Community Mission
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          About Jabalpuriya
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-hindi">
          संस्कारधानी को अपनी जड़ों से जोड़ने का एक आत्मीय प्रयास — Your Home Away From Home
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- About Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Who We Are</h2>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Jabalpuriya.com</strong> is a dedicated digital news portal and community platform headquartered in Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh. Founded with the mission to connect the residents and global diaspora of <em>Sanskaardhani</em>. We are building this platform from the ground up with the vision to connect people and make this your home away from home.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm font-hindi leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
            चाहे आप जबलपुर में रह रहे हों, या देश-विदेश के किसी भी कोने में — जबलपुरिया का उद्देश्य संस्कारधानी की मिट्टी, संस्कृति, मां नर्मदा के पावन तटों और स्थानीय गतिविधियों से आपका निरंतर जीवंत संपर्क बनाए रखना है।
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Our Core Values & Community Vision</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
            <li><strong>Connecting Diaspora Globally:</strong> Giving every Jabalpurian across the world a shared digital space to stay rooted with local updates, festivals, and memories.</li>
            <li><strong>Constructive & Positive Updates:</strong> Prioritizing inspiring news, city progress, cultural celebrations, educational milestones, and sports.</li>
            <li><strong>Fair Source Attribution:</strong> Curating stories responsibly with direct attribution and links to original news sources and wire agencies.</li>
            <li><strong>Civic & Community Utilities:</strong> Offering helpful day-to-day tools including Jabalpur Mandi bhav, Indian stock market rates, Vedic panchang, Bhedaghat tourism guides, and emergency city helplines.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Get in Touch & Join the Community</h2>
          <p>
            Have feedback, an idea, or want to connect with fellow Jabalpurians? Reach out to us anytime via our <a href="/contact/" class="text-jabalpur-secondary underline font-semibold">Contact & Feedback Page</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-center">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-jabalpur-primary text-white hover:bg-jabalpur-secondary transition-all shadow-md">
          ← Back to Jabalpuriya Home
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
